📘 1. Project Description

The Astrometric Proton Propulsion Simulation Engine (APP‑SE) is a multi‑scale scientific simulation framework for modeling laser‑driven proton propulsion inside real astrophysical environments.It integrates plasma physics, cosmic data ingestion, magnetic nozzle dynamics, and HPC execution into a unified engine simulation instrument.

APP‑SE is designed for researchers exploring:

Proton acceleration

Laser–plasma interaction

Magnetic nozzle shaping

Cosmic‑embedded propulsion concepts

High‑specific‑impulse engine modeling

