🌌 3. Scientific Motivation

Traditional propulsion simulations assume laboratory isolation.APP‑SE embeds the engine inside cosmic structure fields, enabling study of:

Proton acceleration under astrophysical boundary conditions

Magnetic topology effects on thrust

Cosmic‑ray modulation of proton energy

Environmental turbulence impacts on beam stability

This reframes propulsion as a cosmic‑embedded physics system.

